        "Content": "Detached two bedroom house.\r\nRefurbishment opportunity.\r\nSought after location approximately 7km from Greystones, 4km from Kilmacanogue and 9km from Bray.\r\nPicturesque setting at the foot of the Wicklow Mountains.\r\nExtending to approximately 197 sq. m (2,120 sq. ft).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides a detached two bedroom house with a garden to the rear. The property is arranged over ground and one upper floor beneath a pitched roof. This property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 197 sq. m (2,120 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant Possession."
